OL,3,ATeacher who sexually abused pupil back
OL,4,Ain Indonesia jail after BBC
OL,5,Ainvestigation
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former teacher who sexually assaulted
OL,8,Fa student has been returned to jail in
OL,9,FIndonesia after a BBC investigation
OL,10,Frevealed he was secretly released
OL,11,Fearly.
OL,13,FMochamad Subchi Azal Tsani, known as
OL,14,FBechi, was sentenced to seven years in
OL,15,Fprison in 2022 after being convicted of
OL,16,Fsexually assaulting a female student at
OL,17,Fhis father's prominent Islamic boarding
OL,18,Fschool in East Java, where he worked as
OL,19,Fa teacher.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
