OL,3,ATeacher who sexually abused pupil back
OL,4,Ain Indonesia jail after BBC
OL,5,Ainvestigation
OL,6,
OL,7,FA BBC Eye undercover investigation
OL,8,Frevealed he was secretly released on
OL,9,Fparole in August 2025, after serving
OL,10,Fless than half his sentence. The woman
OL,11,Fhe had been convicted of assaulting had
OL,12,Fnot been informed - despite her legal
OL,13,Fright to know.
OL,15,FOn hearing he was back in prison, she
OL,16,Fcried with relief.
